  "directives": "* SCR trigger - VFMM 2026 (translated from LTspice)\n* XU1 PC817A opto -> D9 LED + R12 + C3 + G1 + Q1 drawn explicit\n* XQ1 Qpt41c SCR  -> S3 switch + D10 body diode\n* node 12v -> v12 (node tokens never start with a digit)\n* Vf1/Vf2 source expressions -> PULSE waves; startup -> .options itl4=100\n.model 1N4148 D(IS=4.352E-9 N=1.906 BV=110 IBV=0.0001 RS=0.6458 CJO=7.048E-13 VJ=0.869 M=0.03 FC=0.5 TT=3.48E-9 EG=1.11 XTI=3)\n.model 1N4007 D(IS=1e-14 N=1.05 RS=10)\n.model MUR460 D(IS=1e-14 N=1.05 RS=10 BV=600)\n.model BC337-25 NPN(IS=1e-14 BF=250 VAF=100 IKF=0.1 RC=1)\n.model LD D(Is=1e-20 Cjo=18p)\n.model NP NPN(Bf=1200 Vaf=140 Ikf=100m Rc=1 Cjc=19p Cje=7p)\n.model D_SCR D(Is=1e-14)\n.model mch1 SW(Ron=10m Roff=100Meg Vt=.5 Vh=-.4)\n.model mch2 SW(Ron=10m Roff=100Meg Vt=.5 Vh=-.4)\n.model SW_SCR SW(Ron=10m Roff=100Meg Vt=0.5 Vh=-0.4)\n.options itl4=100\n.step param ch1 list 0 1\n.step param ch2 list 0 1\n.step param pot1 list 0.001 0.5 0.999\n.step param load1 list 3300m 20",
  "view": {
    "zoom": 0.5,
    "center": [
      0.5,
      -9.5
    ]
  }
